	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="3" class="citation8">A Superior Court judge on Tuesday ordered credit card giants Visa and MasterCard to refund an estimated $800 million to U.S. customers who paid a hidden fee on purchases made in foreign countries.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/11_ds_386920.asp">Full Story</a>
