	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="3" class="citation8">The number of minorities in newsrooms has inched up from a year ago, but still lags behind both the national population as a whole and the goal editors have set for themselves, according to a survey by the American Society of Newspaper Editors.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/11_ds_386660.asp">Full Story</a>
